```
enum ByteStreamStatus : U8 {
    OP_OK         @< Operation worked as expected
    SEND_RETRY    @< Data send should be retried
    RECV_NO_DATA  @< Receive worked, but there was no data 
    OTHER_ERROR   @< Error occurred, retrying may succeed
}
```

**Definition**:  
`SEND_RETRY` is a status code indicating that a data send operation should be retried. It is part of the `ByteStreamStatus` enum used in the `Drv` module to report the result of send operations via the `ByteStreamSend` port. This status is explicitly documented in the [ByteStreamDriverModel.fpp](https://github.com/nasa/fprime/blob/devel/Drv/ByteStreamDriverModel/ByteStreamDriverModel.fpp) source file.

